     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>A reminder that at D-RUG today, we&#39;ll have a joint talk by Ryan Peek and Michele Tobias on making maps in R.  Details below.  Regular time and place: Wickson 2124, 10AM-Noon.  The first hour will be the Ryan and Michele show, the second our regular co-work/Q&amp;A time.</div><div><br></div><div>Noam</div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Noam Ross</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">noam...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Tue, Feb 17, 2015 at 9:38 AM<br>Subject: [D-RUG]: This week: Mapping in R with Ryan Peek and Michele Tobias<br>To: Davis R Users Group &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.1999998092651px;line-height:20px\"></span><div style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);border:none;line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Hi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">This week at D-RUG we’ll have a joint talk by <a href=\"http://ucdavis.academia.edu/RyanPeek\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ucdavis.academia.edu/RyanPeek&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468404278000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QOOc3T5R4aIHyJiAfsVRj\">Ryan Peek</a> and <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/mtobiasresearch/\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sites.google.com/site/mtobiasresearch/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468404278000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tPUYHSFnbECc23J05Tlth\">Michele Tobias</a> about different approaches to producing maps in R, including <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggmap/index.html\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggmap/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468404279000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mltN9gnlDJnUyBm3cJUGl\">ggmap</a>, <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/googleVis/index.html\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/googleVis/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468404279000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QNFQkW8hSocr1RMgD9Vi9\">googlevis</a>, and <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/leafletR/index.html\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/leafletR/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468404279000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0hj5Gg2bBTbioBHbtP8Ar5\">leafletR</a>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">For a preview of the kinds of maps you can create with these tools, see <a href=\"http://micheletobias.github.io/maps/DistributionsMap.html\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://micheletobias.github.io/maps/DistributionsMap.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468404279000&amp;usg=AOvVaw14RRxgLlH-YRCqWAk1VK3e\">Michele’s maps of California Beach Plant Species Distributions</a>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">We’ll webcast the talk at this link: <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/events/csq6las4056etldd0t8isauebho\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://plus.google.com/events/csq6las4056etldd0t8isauebho&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468404279000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2X3RRAdnGJLKMfJiZFhzDj\">https://plus.google.com/events/csq6las4056etldd0t8isauebho</a>.  Video and code will be available afterwards.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Best, </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Noam</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PHNwYW4gc3R5bGU9ImNvbG9yOiByZ2IoMzMsIDMzLCAzMyk7IGZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiAnSGVsdmV0\r\naWNhIE5ldWUnLCBIZWx2ZXRpY2EsIEFyaWFsLCBzYW5zLXNlcmlmOyBmb250LXNpemU6IDEzLjE5\r\nOTk5OTgwOTI2NTFweDsgbGluZS1oZWlnaHQ6IDIwcHg7Ij5IaSBhbGwsPC9zcGFuPjxkaXYgc3R5\r\nbGU9ImNvbG9yOiByZ2IoMzMsIDMzLCAzMyk7IGZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiAnSGVsdmV0aWNhIE5ldWUn\r\nLCBIZWx2ZXRpY2EsIEFyaWFsLCBzYW5zLXNlcmlmOyBmb250LXNpemU6IDEzLjE5OTk5OTgwOTI2\r\nNTFweDsgbGluZS1oZWlnaHQ6IDIwcHg7Ij48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdiBzdHlsZT0iY29sb3I6IHJn\r\nYigzMywgMzMsIDMzKTsgZm9udC1mYW1pbHk6ICdIZWx2ZXRpY2EgTmV1ZScsIEhlbHZldGljYSwg\r\nQXJpYWwsIHNhbnMtc2VyaWY7IGZvbnQtc2l6ZTogMTMuMTk5OTk5ODA5MjY1MXB4OyBsaW5lLWhl\r\naWdodDogMjBweDsiPlRoaXMgd2VlayBhdCBELVJVRyB3ZSdsbCBoYXZlIGEgam9pbnQgdGFsayBi\r\neSBbUnlhbiBQZWVrXShodHRwOi8vdWNkYXZpcy5hY2FkZW1pYS5lZHUvUnlhblBlZWspIGFuZCBb\r\nTWljaGVsZSBUb2JpYXNdKGh0dHBzOi8vc2l0ZXMuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbS9zaXRlL210b2JpYXNyZXNl\r\nYXJjaC8pIGFib3V0IGRpZmZlcmVudCBhcHByb2FjaGVzIHRvIHByb2R1Y2luZyBtYXBzIGluIFIs\r\nIGluY2x1ZGluZyBbZ2dtYXBdKDxzcGFuIHN0eWxlPSJmb250LXNpemU6IDEzLjE5OTk5OTgwOTI2\r\nNTFweDsiPmh0dHA6Ly9jcmFuLnItcHJvamVjdC5vcmcvd2ViL3BhY2thZ2VzL2dnbWFwL2luZGV4\r\nLmh0bWwpPC9zcGFuPjxzcGFuIHN0eWxlPSJmb250LXNpemU6IDEzLjE5OTk5OTgwOTI2NTFweDsi\r\nPiwgW2dvb2dsZXZpc10oPC9zcGFuPjxzcGFuIHN0eWxlPSJmb250LXNpemU6IDEzLjE5OTk5OTgw\r\nOTI2NTFweDsiPmh0dHA6Ly9jcmFuLnItcHJvamVjdC5vcmcvd2ViL3BhY2thZ2VzL2dvb2dsZVZp\r\ncy9pbmRleC5odG1sKTwvc3Bhbj48c3BhbiBzdHlsZT0iZm9udC1zaXplOiAxMy4xOTk5OTk4MDky\r\nNjUxcHg7Ij4sIGFuZCBbbGVhZmxldFJdKDwvc3Bhbj48c3BhbiBzdHlsZT0iZm9udC1zaXplOiAx\r\nMy4xOTk5OTk4MDkyNjUxcHg7Ij5odHRwOi8vY3Jhbi5yLXByb2plY3Qub3JnL3dlYi9wYWNrYWdl\r\ncy9sZWFmbGV0Ui9pbmRleC5odG1sKS48L3NwYW4+PC9kaXY+PGRpdi